Parity with web/src/features/dashboard/widgets/CostBreakdownWidget.tsx:
  - States loading / error(QueryError->ErrorDisplay+retry) / empty("No cost data") / stale / offline reproduced; plus the
    two web bodies: compact monthly-total hero and standard donut+ranked-list+stat-cards.
  - Data: shared useVehicles (default = first vehicle id) + useCostBreakdown (GET /analytics/tco?vehicle_id=) decoded from
    raw SI JSON; display prefs (distance unit + currency_symbol||"$" + decimal_precision||2) from /settings (useUnits/useFormatting).
  - Compact hero: currentMonthCost (last monthly_breakdown.ev_cost) as AnimatedNumber (reduce-motion -> static MetricValue) +
    currency-symbol unit, "This Month" label, "Saved {amount} vs gas" subtitle when monthly_savings>0, "Saving" success badge
    when total_savings>0; folded into one TalkBack phrase.
  - Standard: Canvas donut ring of the last 6 months (innerR 55% / outerR 85% / 2 deg gap, theme palette), a ranked monthly
    list (sort desc by ev_cost, top 5, background bar = value/max, palette by original index, per-row TalkBack phrase), and
    three StatCards: Total Cost (formatCurrency, precision), Cost / {unit} (cost_per_km_ev * 1.60934 for mi else *1, 3 dp, em-dash
    when 0), Gas Savings (total_savings, +"Lifetime" sublabel, em-dash when <=0).
  - Currency/number formatting reproduces web useFormatting formatCurrency via shared ChartFormat.number (locale grouping);
    MI_TO_KM=1.60934 matches the web constant.
  - Registry: id "cost-breakdown", category "analytics", default 2x4, min 1x2, max 4x40 (CostBreakdownRegistration).
  - i18n: translation_widget_costBreakdown_{title,monthlyTotal,savedVsGas,saving,noData,totalCost,costPerDist,gasSavings,lifetime}
    (all already present in the S10 catalog res/values*) + translation_common_{loading,refresh,retry} +
    translation_error_serverError_{title,message}. No hardcoded English in native code.
  - Diagnostics: view.opened with slug=CostBreakdownWidget (PII-safe, emitted exactly once).
  - Accessibility: refresh control + ranked rows + compact hero + donut carry contentDescription; reduce-motion respected.

